      "side": 1,
      "message": "This bundles at least three independent changes: profile selection + run-ci restructure, a full rewrite of the dependency handler (handle-depend-on-instructions.sh), and a new ~1068-line artifact helper (qemu-artifact.py). Please split these into separate changes so each can be reviewed and reverted independently - the dependency-handler rewrite in particular changes pipeline-wide behavior and shouldn\u0027t ride along in an S2/QEMU-scoped change.",
      "tag": "review",
      "revId": "e0d798540a49ab5013a325a8d30d436e66022b11",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
