        "id": 1039387
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-31T16:46:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This uses `-` not `:-` - if a caller exports the variable but empty, it stays empty instead of defaulting to 5, and load_config.sh will then fail to find the profile. If an empty value should also mean \u0027use default,\u0027 switch to `:-`.",
      "tag": "review",
      "revId": "e0d798540a49ab5013a325a8d30d436e66022b11",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
