      "writtenOn": "2026-10-31T16:46:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This now hard-fails the build on dependency problems (abandoned dependencies, malformed Depends-on trailers, unsupported Gerrit statuses, SSH metadata failures), where the prior behavior could print the failure and still exit 0. This handler runs for every change\u0027s CI, not just QEMU work, so this is a pipeline-wide behavior change that deserves its own change and justification - please confirm no currently-open change relies on the old soft-fail behavior.",
      "tag": "review",
      "revId": "e0d798540a49ab5013a325a8d30d436e66022b11",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
