      "message": "This ~1068-line module has no in-tree tests - the commit message references an external validation harness, but nothing here runs under this repo\u0027s test suite/CI. For this to land, the checks need to live in-tree and run against real fixtures (e.g. the actual configs.json, a real ssd.conf.template-style input), not an out-of-tree harness.",
