      "writtenOn": "2026-10-31T16:46:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The subject says \u0027reuse build artifacts,\u0027 but the live pipeline doesn\u0027t reuse anything yet - compile-qemu.sh\u0027s 26.04 path builds QEMU 11 purely as a check and discards it, run-ci.sh never invokes select_artifact/publish and explicitly rejects EVSSIM_QEMU_INPUT_RECORD, and nothing in-tree sets EVSSIM_DEPENDENCY_RECORD. That\u0027s fine if integration is deferred to S3/S7, but worth saying explicitly in the commit message that this half ships unexercised.",
      "tag": "review",
      "revId": "e0d798540a49ab5013a325a8d30d436e66022b11",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
